eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1f2dfd560b6a3552a9037845740c8e65', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '82cee8fe2fd702c53be966cb6fc1bbfe'}, page_content='Received: 12 March 2024 Revised: 28 March 2024 Accepted: 2 April 2024 Published: 4 April 2024'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9514484405517578, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(812.2867977777778), np.float64(2751.4174624999996)), (np.float64(812.2867977777778), np.float64(3236.1530541666666)), (np.float64(2731.5005511111094), np.float64(3236.1530541666666)), (np.float64(2731.5005511111094), np.float64(2751.4174624999996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '244664634501d02b08a851d38c648f76'}, page_content='The advent of LLMs is changing the paradigm in natural language processing (NLP) toward improved classiﬁcation, generation, and understanding of texts. However, gen- eral-purpose LLMs often require further adaptation to advance their performance in spe- ciﬁc tasks or specialized domains. This has led to the development of diﬀerent approaches to enhancing the performance of the models. Their goal has been to overcome the inherent limitations of pre-trained large-scale models. In this regard, the following models can be mentioned: full ﬁne-tuning, parameter-eﬃcient ﬁne-tuning (PEFT), prompt engineering, and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9039924740791321, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(167.9416961669922), np.float64(3224.305419921875)), (np.float64(167.9416961669922), np.float64(3670.54248046875)), (np.float64(743.8818969726562), np.float64(3670.54248046875)), (np.float64(743.8818969726562), np.float64(3224.305419921875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7fc84120ae547860f63d2d5ee511f53e'}, page_content='Copyright: © 2024 by the authors. Licensee MDPI, Basel, Switzerland. This article is an open access article distributed under the terms and conditions of the Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY) license (https://creativecommons.org/license s/by/4.0/).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9392389059066772, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(809.2283935546875), np.float64(3249.8595791666667)), (np.float64(809.2283935546875), np.float64(3547.6428458333335)), (np.float64(2731.062351111111), np.float64(3547.6428458333335)), (np.float64(2731.062351111111), np.float64(3249.8595791666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4f31d0731990acd01dfacc7e05078cf7'}, page_content='Full ﬁne-tuning [1] is a method in which tuning occurs by adjusting all LLM param- eters to speciﬁc data for a single task. This requires less data and oﬀers greater accuracy and robustness of the results. The large scale of LLMs, however, makes the method’s im- plementation computationally expensive, requiring signiﬁcant memory, time, and exper- tise.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9292606115341187, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(792.2528686523438), np.float64(3561.07861328125)), (np.float64(792.2528686523438), np.float64(3735.4130859375)), (np.float64(2734.134033203125), np.float64(3735.4130859375)), (np.float64(2734.134033203125), np.float64(3561.07861328125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '367514486b6b59c5715feca85fea2027'}, page_content='Parameter-eﬃcient ﬁne-tuning (PEFT) [2] emerged simultaneously, outlining an al- ternative strategy. The method focuses on modifying a selected number of parameters. The results are better (faster) learning performance and knowledge retention from pre-'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6579321026802063, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(175.0), np.float64(3970.390375)), (np.float64(175.0), np.float64(4009.1820416666665)), (np.float64(1357.4820721874996), np.float64(4009.1820416666665)), (np.float64(1357.4820721874996), np.float64(3970.390375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '42131c17b136165afbe49522cc14a7ae'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361. https://doi.org/10.3390/electronics13071361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2105.8283693125), np.float64(3970.390375)), (np.float64(2105.8283693125), np.float64(4009.1820416666665)), (np.float64(2728.6424580624985), np.float64(4009.1820416666665)), (np.float64(2728.6424580624985), np.float64(3970.390375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 1, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '1e2215539aa2b264e65bb46fe56f078c'}, page_content='www.mdpi.com/journal/electronics'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8979523777961731, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(175.0), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(175.0), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8815804719924927, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(799.3319702148438), np.float64(457.2569885253906)), (np.float64(799.3319702148438), np.float64(568.7415771484375)), (np.float64(2731.067208333333), np.float64(568.7415771484375)), (np.float64(2731.067208333333), np.float64(457.2569885253906))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'cd350992a912bce660580822a5246528'}, page_content='training. However, the performance of PEFT depends on the complexity of the task and the technique chosen, as it updates far fewer parameters in comparison to full ﬁne-tuning.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9445525407791138, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879625), np.float64(581.9925999999995)), (np.float64(808.7879625), np.float64(1004.6055833333313)), (np.float64(2731.8368), np.float64(1004.6055833333313)), (np.float64(2731.8368), np.float64(581.9925999999995))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '14de1e53a6b0121c148f218eac3262fe'}, page_content='In [3], the prompt engineering method is presented. This technique does not involve training network weights. To inﬂuence the desired output, it involves crafting the input to the model. This approach includes zero-shot prompting, few-shot prompting, and chain-of-thought prompting, each oﬀering a way to guide the model’s response without direct modiﬁcation of its parameters. This method leverages the ﬂexibility and capability of LLM and provides a tool to adapt the model without the computational cost of retrain- ing.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9450887441635132, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.4443969726562), np.float64(1018.3121083333311)), (np.float64(807.4443969726562), np.float64(1692.573486328125)), (np.float64(2731.3010083333347), np.float64(1692.573486328125)), (np.float64(2731.3010083333347), np.float64(1018.3121083333311))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e3c5151e7d108711860300ef5971439c'}, page_content='RAG, introduced in [4], enhances language models by combining prompt engineer- ing and database querying to provide context-rich answers, reducing errors and adapting to new data eﬃciently. The main concepts involve a combination of pre-trained language models with external knowledge retrieval, enabling dynamic, informed content genera- tion. It is cost-eﬀective and allows for traceable responses, making it interpretable. The development of retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) represents a signiﬁcant advance- ment in the ﬁeld of natural language processing (NLP). However, for deeper task-speciﬁc adaptations, like analysing ﬁnancial or medical records, ﬁne-tuning may be preferable. RAG’s integration of retrieval and generation techniques addresses LLM issues like inac- curacies and opaque logic, yet incorporating varied knowledge and ensuring information relevance and accuracy remain challenges [5].'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9235221743583679, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.2967529296875), np.float64(1703.4289124999966)), (np.float64(807.2967529296875), np.float64(1876.966962499997)), (np.float64(2731.0282416666673), np.float64(1876.966962499997)), (np.float64(2731.0282416666673), np.float64(1703.4289124999966))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f1ec367365160bbdfdbc00cd750189cb'}, page_content='Each method oﬀers a speciﬁc approach to improving LLM performance. Choosing between them depends on the desired balance between the required results, the available resources, and the nature of the tasks set.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9491738080978394, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.3674926757812), np.float64(1890.319091796875)), (np.float64(807.3674926757812), np.float64(2313.0400416666666)), (np.float64(2731.315620833335), np.float64(2313.0400416666666)), (np.float64(2731.315620833335), np.float64(1890.319091796875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6d98c9c93a27df365906d7e15c3bdc2b'}, page_content='In fact, there are other diﬀerent methods in this ﬁeld. They are founded on these basic approaches or applied in parallel. For example, dense passage retrieval (DPR) [6] and the retrieval-augmented language model (REALM) [7] reﬁne retrieval mechanisms similar to RAG. Fusion-in-decoder (FiD) [8] integrates information from multiple sources into the decoding process. There are various knowledge-based modelling and meta-learning ap- proaches. Each of these models reﬂects eﬀorts to extend the capabilities of pre-trained lan- guage models and oﬀer solutions for a wide range of NLP tasks.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9259306192398071, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.73828125), np.float64(2326.4543166666663)), (np.float64(807.73828125), np.float64(2562.114975)), (np.float64(2751.517578125), np.float64(2562.114975)), (np.float64(2751.517578125), np.float64(2326.4543166666663))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '71a6ab74758ac089b325cff03fdd7c4a'}, page_content='The purpose of this paper is to explore the implementation of retriever-augmented generation (RAG) technology with open-source large language models (LLMs). In order to support this research, a web-based application PaSSER that allows the integration, testing and evaluation of such models in a structured environment has been developed.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.932623028755188, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7867958333331), np.float64(2575.8215)), (np.float64(808.7867958333331), np.float64(2873.604766666667)), (np.float64(2733.97900390625), np.float64(2873.604766666667)), (np.float64(2733.97900390625), np.float64(2575.8215))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd9ee79e2bda116ec574ceab9b141e42b'}, page_content='The paper discusses the architecture of the web application, the technological tools used, the models selected for integration, and the set of functionalities developed to oper- ate and evaluate these models. The evaluation of the models has two aspects: operation on diﬀerent computational infrastructures and performance in text generation and sum- marization tasks.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9367340207099915, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7867958333333), np.float64(2887.3112916666664)), (np.float64(808.7867958333333), np.float64(3185.094558333333)), (np.float64(2731.4021291666622), np.float64(3185.094558333333)), (np.float64(2731.4021291666622), np.float64(2887.3112916666664))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '00621fbbc77e145012adcb8d07a4b27c'}, page_content='The domain of smart agriculture is chosen as the empirical domain for testing the models. Furthermore, the web application is open-source, which promotes transparency and collaborative improvement. A detailed guide on installing and conﬁguring the appli- cation, the datasets generated for testing purposes, and the results of the experimental evaluations are provided and available on GitHub [9].'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9505144953727722, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.9202270507812), np.float64(3198.8010833333333)), (np.float64(807.9202270507812), np.float64(3683.906005859375)), (np.float64(2731.494675000003), np.float64(3683.906005859375)), (np.float64(2731.494675000003), np.float64(3198.8010833333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '1befb15f78d9a35e05b328b7cb32acd1', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '06976ba72af15df52eaffee170772c20'}, page_content='The application allows adaptive testing of diﬀerent scenarios. It integrates three of the leading LLMs, Mistral:7b, Llama2:7b, and Orca2:7b, which do not require signiﬁcant computational resources. The selection of the Mistral:7b, Llama2:7b, and Orca2:7b models is driven by an approach aimed at balancing performance and aﬀordability. The selected models were determined due to their respective volume parameters that allow installation and operation in mid-range conﬁgurations. Given the appropriate computational re- sources, without further reﬁnement, the PaSSER application allows the use of arbitrary open-source LLMs with more parameters.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8553400039672852, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2578.9560546875), np.float64(256.1808776855469)), (np.float64(2578.9560546875), np.float64(300.49127197265625)), (np.float64(2728.608866666666), np.float64(300.49127197265625)), (np.float64(2728.608866666666), np.float64(256.1808776855469))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 2, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'f44b61d6a9ba94bac77de366ee2174a0'}, page_content='2 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8908162117004395, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(174.1068878173828), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(174.1068878173828), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333),