ge_content='and used on hardware conﬁgurations with medium computational capacity, while giving good enough results. A brief description of the models is presented below.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9441214799880981, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(806.9501953125), np.float64(581.9925999999995)), (np.float64(806.9501953125), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.4373916666673), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.4373916666673), np.float64(581.9925999999995))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fef0aa4aa5cbd6b31619dd2567821297'}, page_content='Mistral:7b “https://mistral.ai/news/announcing-mistral-7b/ (accessed on 23 March 2024)” is a language model developed by Mistral AI with a capacity of 7.3 billion param- eters. It is available under the Apache 2.0 license, so it can be used without restrictions. The model can be downloaded and used anywhere, including locally, and deployed on any cloud (AWS/GCP/Azure) using the LLM inference server and SkyPilot.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9408097863197327, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7977041666659), np.float64(893.482391666665)), (np.float64(808.7977041666659), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.1013041666647), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.1013041666647), np.float64(893.482391666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c38c00fa87c4fc8fedab292ae83c5cc8'}, page_content='It is structured to process language data, facilitating a wide range of text-based ap- plications. This model incorporates speciﬁc attention mechanisms, namely grouped-query attention (GQA) and sliding window attention (SWA), aimed at optimizing the processing speed and managing longer text inputs. These technological choices are intended to im- prove the model’s performance while managing computational resources eﬀectively [29– 31].'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9474008083343506, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.807445833333), np.float64(1267.396783333331)), (np.float64(808.807445833333), np.float64(1939.0944416666634)), (np.float64(2731.8611541666683), np.float64(1939.0944416666634)), (np.float64(2731.8611541666683), np.float64(1267.396783333331))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8052f7a0ed35f879b1eb321821604a93'}, page_content='Llama2:7b “https://llama.meta.com/llama2/ (accessed on 23 March 2024)” is a series of large language models developed by Meta, oﬀering variations in size from 7 billion to 70 billion parameters. The 7 billion parameter version, Llama 2:7b, is part of this collection and is designed for a broad range of text-based tasks, from generative text models to more speciﬁc applications like chatbots. The architecture of Llama 2 models is auto-regressive, utilizing an optimized transformer structure. These models have been pre-trained on a mix of publicly available online data and can be ﬁne-tuned for speciﬁc applications. They employ an auto-regressive language model framework and have been optimized for var- ious natural language processing tasks, including chat and dialogue scenarios through supervised ﬁne-tuning (SFT) and reinforcement learning with human feedback (RLHF) [32].'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9493472576141357, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8123166666666), np.float64(1952.8009666666633)), (np.float64(808.8123166666666), np.float64(2437.5365583333305)), (np.float64(2731.369199999999), np.float64(2437.5365583333305)), (np.float64(2731.369199999999), np.float64(1952.8009666666633))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7883e767564b0690892b97db934c5d29'}, page_content='Llama2:7b models have been trained on signiﬁcant computational resources and have a considerable carbon footprint, which Meta has committed to oﬀsetting as part of their sustainability program. The 7b model speciﬁcally consumed 184,320 GPU hours and emit- ted an estimated 31.22 tCO2eq during its training, with all emissions directly oﬀset. These models are intended for both commercial and research purposes, and while they have been primarily tested in English, they carry the potential for a broad array of applications. Meta has provided a custom commercial license for Llama 2, and details on accessing this license can be found on their website.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9501110911369324, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8220583333331), np.float64(2451.2430833333306)), (np.float64(808.8220583333331), np.float64(2935.978674999997)), (np.float64(2731.452004166667), np.float64(2935.978674999997)), (np.float64(2731.452004166667), np.float64(2451.2430833333306))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '58ee0a0d9787dc67fb32905e3fefcdda'}, page_content='Orca2:7b, Orca 2 [33], developed by Microsoft, is a ﬁne-tuned version of the Llama 2 model with two versions: one with 7 billion and the other with 13 billion parameters. It focuses on improving the reasoning abilities of smaller language models through en- hanced training methods. By employing high-quality synthetic data for training, Orca 2 is designed to master various reasoning techniques such as step-by-step processing and re- call-then-generate strategies. This synthetic training data is crafted to guide the model in adopting diﬀerent solution strategies appropriate for varied tasks, aiming to optimize the model’s problem-solving approach.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9438323378562927, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7942333333336), np.float64(2949.6851999999976)), (np.float64(808.7942333333336), np.float64(3309.9488916666664)), (np.float64(2731.2537), np.float64(3309.9488916666664)), (np.float64(2731.2537), np.float64(2949.6851999999976))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '01a3be680316a499c8fd428fc4e5ee26'}, page_content='The model is a result of research aimed at leveraging the advancements in large lan- guage models to boost the performance of smaller models, making them more eﬃcient and versatile in handling tasks that require complex reasoning. The initiative behind Orca 2 is to provide a resource for research into the development, evaluation, and alignment of language models, particularly focusing on smaller models that can perform eﬃciently across a range of tasks.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9367694854736328, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7942333333336), np.float64(3323.3631666666665)), (np.float64(808.7942333333336), np.float64(3621.438683333333)), (np.float64(2731.4534041666643), np.float64(3621.438683333333)), (np.float64(2731.4534041666643), np.float64(3323.3631666666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'df6d914b37307fe0942033e1c3e0e936', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '061f97e0f50aa7b1f860b63f707fff53'}, page_content='Orca 2 is available for public use and research, underscoring Microsoft’s commitment to advancing the ﬁeld of AI and language model technology. It represents an eﬀort to explore how smaller models can be enhanced to approach a variety of tasks more eﬀec- tively without the extensive computational and environmental costs associated with larger models.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8577134609222412, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2579.767333984375), np.float64(257.268798828125)), (np.float64(2579.767333984375), np.float64(299.9389343261719)), (np.float64(2728.608866666666), np.float64(299.9389343261719)), (np.float64(2728.608866666666), np.float64(257.268798828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 5, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '85fb2bc32515299fddebd57bf8fd5de9'}, page_content='5 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8990472555160522, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(175.0), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(175.0), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '0e105d4b23961e88333082292d84386c'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7744312882423401, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.3572998046875), np.float64(457.7473833333332)), (np.float64(805.3572998046875), np.float64(506.45571666666643)), (np.float64(1473.3184355555552), np.float64(506.45571666666643)), (np.float64(1473.3184355555552), np.float64(457.7473833333332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '0e105d4b23961e88333082292d84386c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4fa2fb761bc48ba3fadc2bf093ebbb79'}, page_content='2.2. PaSSER App Functionalities'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9487429857254028, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7783977777784), np.float64(532.0079345703125)), (np.float64(808.7783977777784), np.float64(1268.2735333333314)), (np.float64(2731.3419466666655), np.float64(1268.2735333333314)), (np.float64(2731.3419466666655), np.float64(532.0079345703125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '0e105d4b23961e88333082292d84386c', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'adfc571e8e8ecdee829bbb5b12282780'}, page_content='The site map for the PaSSER App is depicted in Figure 2, detailing its core features. Figure 2 provides a structured ﬂowchart of the PaSSER App’s user interface, mapping out the navigation pathways for various functionalities, such as the creation and management of a vector store, chat interactions, testing protocols, conﬁguration settings, database man- agement, and user authentication. Each section outlines the sequence of user actions and choices, from inputting data to exporting test results, conﬁguring system settings, and maintaining the database. These include user authentication (login), system conﬁguration (conﬁguration setup), creation and management of vector stores from various sources (text, PDF ﬁles, and websites), and functionalities for engaging with the stored data through Q&A chat and RAG Q&A chat based on the established vector stores. Addition- ally, a testing module is outlined to evaluate the application’s functionalities and perfor- mance.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8247215151786804, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(800.7872314453125), np.float64(2622.27783203125)), (np.float64(800.7872314453125), np.float64(2670.310546875)), (np.float64(1338.3295032430553), np.float64(2670.310546875)), (np.float64(1338.3295032430553), np.float64(2622.27783203125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0a16fef2d717fe212592ca9a5da87668'}, page_content='Figure 2. PaSSER site map.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9492270946502686, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.3436279296875), np.float64(2738.389404296875)), (np.float64(807.3436279296875), np.float64(3413.2802734375)), (np.float64(2731.3019999999988), np.float64(3413.2802734375)), (np.float64(2731.3019999999988), np.float64(2738.389404296875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '62525c879693bbcc0f94b267a9bc463a'}, page_content='The ‘Create vectorstore’ feature, as depicted in Figure 3, outlines the process of con- verting raw textual data into a structured, queryable vector space using LangChain. This transformation of NLP and vector embedding techniques makes it possible to convert text into a format convenient for vector operations. Users can source textual data from text ﬁles, PDFs, and websites. The outlined procedure for vectorstore creation is standardized across these data types, ensuring consistency in processing and storage. At the current phase, automatic retrieval of information from websites (scrapping) is considered imprac- tical due to the necessity for in-depth analysis of website structures and the requirement for extensive manual intervention to adequately structure the retrieved text. This process involves understanding varied and complex web layouts and imposing a tailored ap- proach to eﬀectively extract and organize data.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8440039157867432, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2576.935791015625), np.float64(257.8247985839844)), (np.float64(2576.935791015625), np.float64(300.9250183105469)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(300.9250183105469)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(257.8247985839844))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 6, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'e58c23ae0aa88af9704f1a5c8560804e'}, page_content='6 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9043362736701965, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(174.00689697265625), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(174.00689697265625), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'a5ad5de6453adece3721d8094976920c'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8509511947631836, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(801.4578247070312), np.float64(1219.3402083333337)), (np.float64(801.4578247070312), np.float64(1263.0902083333337)), (np.float64(1685.4654830902778), np.float64(1263.0902083333337)), (np.float64(1685.4654830902778), np.float64(1219.3402083333337))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7056aa3fcc6777dd461d278a74c32bef'}, page_content='Figure 3. Vectorstore construction workﬂow.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9006283283233643, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.62939453125), np.float64(1332.8858642578125)), (np.float64(807.62939453125), np.float64(1446.2048999999997)), (np.float64(2728.556884765625), np.float64(1446.2048999999997)), (np.float64(2728.556884765625), np.float64(1332.8858642578125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8da24049ee06cabb2e7118c03a8bf5b1'}, page_content='The process for creating a vectorstore involves the following steps, which are com- mon to all three source types:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9067904353141785, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7920088888887), np.float64(1470.6516124999994)), (np.float64(808.7920088888887), np.float64(1709.8679791666661)), (np.float64(2735.555419921875), np.float64(1709.8679791666661)), (np.float64(2735.555419921875), np.float64(1470.6516124999994))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'e604dad2ca0e4757e1d465ec94346e21'}, page_content='1. Cleaning and standardizing text data. This is achieved by removing unnecessary char- acters (punctuation and special characters). Converting the text to a uniform size (usually lower case). Separating the text into individual words or tokens. In the im- plementation considered here, the text is divided into chunks with diﬀerent overlaps.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.922011137008667, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7968777777775), np.float64(1720.0187958333327)), (np.float64(808.7968777777775), np.float64(2024.45751953125)), (np.float64(2731.7596755555574), np.float64(2024.45751953125)), (np.float64(2731.7596755555574), np.float64(1720.0187958333327))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'aac521a47da934bac969b10560dadf48'}, page_content='2. Vector embedding. The goal is to convert tokens (text tokens) into numeric vectors. This is achieved by using pre-trained word embedding models from selected LLMs (in this case, Misrtal:7b, Llama2:7b, and Orca2:7b). These models map words or phrases to high-dimensional vectors. Each word or phrase in the text is transformed into a vector that represents its semantic meaning based on the context in which it appears.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9433652758598328, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(795.305419921875), np.float64(2031.513458333333)), (np.float64(795.305419921875), np.float64(2395.2721624999995)), (np.float64(2749.73193359375), np.float64(2395.2721624999995)), (np.float64(2749.73193359375), np.float64(2031.513458333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'aa1a6b8cd21a61df04275f7418141c33'}, page_content='3. Aggregating embeddings for larger text units to represent whole sentences or docu- ments as vectors. It can be achieved by simple aggregation methods (averaging the vectors of all words in a sentence or document) or by using sentence transformers or document embedding techniques that take into account the more consistent and con- textual nature of words. Here, transformers are used, which are taken from the se- lected LLMs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9291136264801025, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(798.5679931640625), np.float64(2405.1307291666662)), (np.float64(798.5679931640625), np.float64(2582.22509765625)), (np.float64(2739.74658203125), np.float64(2582.22509765625)), (np.float64(2739.74658203125), np.float64(2405.1307291666662))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '1148ac5350a25c46c67994e1ae98d7e4'}, page_content='4. Create a vectorstore to store the vector representations in a structured format. The data structures used are optimized for operations with high-dimensional vectors. Chro- maDB is used for the vectorstore.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9462195634841919, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(804.9873657226562), np.float64(2607.80322265625)), (np.float64(804.9873657226562), np.float64(3345.5634765625)), (np.float64(2732.546875), np.float64(3345.5634765625)), (np.float64(2732.546875), np.float64(2607.80322265625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3924a3daba4f3030ec648e3edd75b3ad'}, page_content='Figure 4 deﬁnes the PaSSER App’s mechanisms for processing user queries and gen- erating responses. Figure 4a represents a general Q&A chat workﬂow with direct input without the augmented context provided by a vectorstore. The corresponding LLM pro- cesses the query, formulates a response, and concurrently provides system performance data, including metrics such as total load and evaluation timeframes. Additionally, a nu- merical array captures the contextual backdrop of the query and the response, drawn from previous dialogue or related data, which the LLM utilizes similar to short-term memory to ensure response relevance and coherence. While the capacity of this memory is limited and not the focus of the current study, it is pivotal in reﬁning responses based on speciﬁc contextual elements such as names and dates. The App enables saving this context for continued dialogue and oﬀers features for initiating new conversations by purging the existing context.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8556062579154968, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2579.00927734375), np.float64(257.74017333984375)), (np.float64(2579.00927734375), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(257.74017333984375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 7, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '922cd3d884cf86bb455661c0a5a36416'}, page_content='7 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8929774165153503, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(172.85891723632812), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(172.85891723632812), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0708561875), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '416b3627b46a0396fc30b0d3509f973f'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.2083333333333), np.float64(1639.6318749999998)), (np.float64(808.2083333333333), np.float64(1683.3818749999998)), (np.float64(1075.4153113958332), np.float64(1683.3818749999998)), (np.float64(1075.4153113958332), np.float64(1639.6318749999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '49201d74f95e6313f82c6ab00621e843'}, page_content='(a) Q&A chat'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(1774.4015821874996), np.float64(1639.6318749999998)), (np.float64(1774.4015821874996), np.float64(1683.3818749999998)), (np.float64(2281.019470284722), np.float64(1683.3818749999998)), (np.float64(2281.019470284722), np.float64(1639.6318749999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '0f9f0e488641e787c0343e58d6176824'}, page_content='(b) RAG-based Q&A chat'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5927972793579102, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(803.6843872070312), np.float64(1725.5428466796875)), (np.float64(803.6843872070312), np.float64(1769.6890869140625)), (np.float64(1422.0921050972224), np.float64(1769.6890869140625)), (np.float64(1422.0921050972224), np.float64(1725.5428466796875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': 'a65977a381818398a20991295417d603'}, page_content='Figure 4. Chat types workﬂow.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9500285387039185, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.792008888889), np.float64(1840.4014892578125)), (np.float64(808.792008888889), np.float64(2575.225566666667)), (np.float64(2731.487017777779), np.float64(2575.225566666667)), (np.float64(2731.487017777779), np.float64(1840.4014892578125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'eca431684e74a1b440c4b6b75ccfaf60'}, page_content='Figure 4b illustrates the workflow of a Q&A chat using the RAG technique, which employs a pre-built vectorstore for data retrieval and response generation. The ‘RAG Q&A chat’ feature facilitates interaction with an existing vectorstore. Users commence the chat by entering a query, triggering the LangChain library to fetch related data from the chosen vectorstore. This data informs the subsequent query to the LLM, integrating the original question, any prompts, and a context enriched by the vectorstore’s information. The LLM then generates a response. Within the app, a dedicated memory buffer recalls history, which the LLM utilizes as a transient context to ensure consistent and logical re- sponses. The limited capacity of this memory buffer and its impact on response quality is acknowledged, though not extensively explored in this study. In the RAG Q&A chat’, context-specific details like names and dates are crucial for enhancing the relevance of responses.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8990159034729004, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7871400000007), np.float64(2588.9320916666666)), (np.float64(808.7871400000007), np.float64(2700.055283333334)), (np.float64(2731.505859375), np.float64(2700.055283333334)), (np.float64(2731.505859375), np.float64(2588.9320916666666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'b7a0be258b4d7d006bddcf2137f72b3b'}, page_content='The fests’ feature is designed to streamline the testing of various LLMs within a specific knowledge domain. It involves the following steps:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.7369914054870605, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7871400000007), np.float64(2724.7893750000003)), (np.float64(808.7871400000007), np.float64(2777.053416666667)), (np.float64(2191.390911111112), np.float64(2777.053416666667)), (np.float64(2191.390911111112), np.float64(2724.7893750000003))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '1e0347667cf5c497da8c8e2306b405eb'}, page_content='Selection of a speciﬁc knowledge base in a speciﬁc domain.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9501126408576965, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.6362915039062), np.float64(2805.0558375)), (np.float64(805.6362915039062), np.float64(3289.7914291666666)), (np.float64(2734.572265625), np.float64(3289.7914291666666)), (np.float64(2734.572265625), np.float64(2805.0558375))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'cde519db67537c0d35e288ef6d461fd3'}, page_content='With Create vectorstore’, the knowledge base is processed and saved in the vector database. In order to evaluate the performance of different LLMs for generating RAG an- swers on a specific domain, it is necessary to prepare a sufficiently large list of questions and reference answers. Such a list can be prepared entirely manually by experts in a spe- cific domain. However, this is a slow and time-consuming process. Another widely used approach is to generate relevant questions based on reference answers given by a selected LLM (i.e., creating respective datasets). PaSSER allows the implementation of the second approach.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9284970760345459, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(803.3352661132812), np.float64(3314.5255208333333)), (np.float64(803.3352661132812), np.float64(3491.327029166667)), (np.float64(2742.513427734375), np.float64(3491.327029166667)), (np.float64(2742.513427734375), np.float64(3314.5255208333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '9b2be9209e34aa91ef02f8cb2f8c3b8b'}, page_content='2. To create a reference dataset for a speciﬁc domain, a collection of answers related to the selected domain is gathered. Each response contains key information related to potential queries in that area. These answers are then saved in a text ﬁle format.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9309388995170593, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(797.049560546875), np.float64(3501.477845833334)), (np.float64(797.049560546875), np.float64(3740.4019625)), (np.float64(2751.033447265625), np.float64(3740.4019625)), (np.float64(2751.033447265625), np.float64(3501.477845833334))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'b459b63e30967f9c68e2f1f0156d9e99'}, page_content='3. A selected LLM is deployed to systematically generate a series of questions corre- sponding to each predeﬁned reference answer. This operation facilitates the creation of a structured dataset comprising pairs of questions and their corresponding an- swers. Subsequently, this dataset is saved in the JSON ﬁle format.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8483208417892456, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2578.898681640625), np.float64(258.3019714355469)), (np.float64(2578.898681640625), np.float64(299.99169921875)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(299.99169921875)), (np.float64(2728.60756), np.float64(258.3019714355469))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 8, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '06163698ba186ee4a73cd5f7cde75079'}, page_content='8 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8892318606376648, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(173.9128875732422), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(173.9128875732422), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 9, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '05fdc273285374be997acd7341b0242b'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.939249575138092, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(804.3119506835938), np.float64(452.1519470214844)), (np.float64(804.3119506835938), np.float64(881.582275390625)), (np.float64(2740.089111328125), np.float64(881.582275390625)), (np.float64(2740.089111328125), np.float64(452.1519470214844))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 9, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '05fdc273285374be997acd7341b0242b', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '3e13e8dc482e3a82c91c54c352afad46'}, page_content='4. The ﬁnalized dataset is uploaded to the PaSSER App, initiating an automated se- quence of response generation for each query within the target domain. Following that, each generated response is forwarded to a dedicated Python backend script. This script is tasked with assessing the responses based on predeﬁned metrics and comparing them to the established reference answers. The outcomes of this evalua- tion are then stored on the blockchain, ensuring a transparent and immutable ledger of the model’s performance metrics.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9179996848106384, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(908.0656666666652)), (np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(1081.6037166666645)), (np.float64(2742.06787109375), np.float64(1081.6037166666645)), (np.float64(2742.06787109375), np.float64(908.0656666666652))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 9, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '05fdc273285374be997acd7341b0242b', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a5d637f7c1c85c8943846bfa166b83a1'}, page_content='To facilitate this process, a smart contract ‘llmtest’ has been created, managing the interaction with the blockchain and providing a structured and secure method for storing and managing the assessment results derived from the LLM performance tests.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9454623460769653, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.7056274414062), np.float64(1095.0228624999982)), (np.float64(805.7056274414062), np.float64(1517.6407166666638)), (np.float64(2731.388683333333), np.float64(1517.6407166666638)), (np.float64(2731.388683333333), np.float64(1095.0228624999982))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 9, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '05fdc273285374be997acd7341b0242b', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fc9d9fab14961131a1934d5fdf5e9b88'}, page_content='The provided pseudocode outlines the structure ‘tests’ and its methods within a blockchain environment, which were chosen to store test-related entries. It includes iden- tiﬁers (id, userid, and testid), a timestamp (created_at), numerical results (results array), and descriptive text (description). It establishes id as the primary key for indexing, with addi- tional indices based on created_at, userid, and testid to facilitate data retrieval and sorting by these attributes. This structure organizes and accesses test records within the block- chain.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(912.0416666666666), np.float64(1573.7971666666667)), (np.float64(912.0416666666666), np.float64(1612.588833333333)), (np.float64(2171.975604166668), np.float64(1612.588833333333)), (np.float64(2171.975604166668), np.float64(1573.7971666666667))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 9, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '05fdc273285374be997acd7341b0242b', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '7eb41257e7c4907b2173e97613e01675'}, page_content='Define a structure ‘tests’ with the following fields:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8871139287948608, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(890.955322265625), np.float64(1590.4859619140625)), (np.float64(890.955322265625), np.float64(2119.86865234375)), (np.float64(2265.3083541666683), np.float64(2119.86865234375)), (np.float64(2265.3083541666683), np.float64