t_id': '20990cdf4cbbd6658643b1b3b97c9bd4'}, page_content='The pseudocodes provided above and in Section 3 are generated with GitHub Copi- lot upon the actual source code available at “https://github.com/features/copilot (accessed on 1 April 2024)”.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7920088888886), np.float64(1258.0199333333323)), (np.float64(808.7920088888886), np.float64(1310.2839749999994)), (np.float64(2660.542437777778), np.float64(1310.2839749999994)), (np.float64(2660.542437777778), np.float64(1258.0199333333323))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a40e486843b3a95a3dbaad6d32f0c950', 'category': 'UncategorizedText', 'element_id': '977e6959ec3459bf34e278438715265b'}, page_content='5. The results from the blockchain are retrieved for further processing and analysis.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9492433667182922, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7968777777775), np.float64(1338.2815249999994)), (np.float64(808.7968777777775), np.float64(1760.894508333332)), (np.float64(2731.267917777778), np.float64(1760.894508333332)), (np.float64(2731.267917777778), np.float64(1338.2815249999994))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a40e486843b3a95a3dbaad6d32f0c950', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '476be66abc6e787845ac0c47f45c361d'}, page_content='To facilitate the execution of these procedures, the interface is structured into three specific features: Q&A dataset’ for managing question and answer datasets, RAG Q&A score test’ for evaluating the performance of RAG utilizing datasets, and Show test re- sults’ for displaying the results of the tests. Each submenu is designed to streamline the respective aspect of the workflow, ensuring a coherent and efficient user experience throughout the process of dataset management, performance evaluation, and result visu- alization.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9451596736907959, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7968777777772), np.float64(1774.3136541666652)), (np.float64(808.7968777777772), np.float64(2134.5166499999987)), (np.float64(2731.22409777778), np.float64(2134.5166499999987)), (np.float64(2731.22409777778), np.float64(1774.3136541666652))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a40e486843b3a95a3dbaad6d32f0c950', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8be20cb739663f122a8caa836472d5cf'}, page_content='Within the Q&A dataset’, the user is guided to employ a specific prompt, aiming to instruct the LLM to generate questions that align closely with the provided reference an- swers, as described in step 2. This operation initiates the creation of a comprehensive da- taset, subsequently organizing and storing this information within a JSON file for future accessibility and analysis. This approach ensures the generation of relevant and accurate questions, thereby enhancing the dataset’s utility for follow-up evaluation processes.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9482058882713318, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.796877777777), np.float64(2148.2231749999987)), (np.float64(808.796877777777), np.float64(2508.4212999999986)), (np.float64(2731.253311111109), np.float64(2508.4212999999986)), (np.float64(2731.253311111109), np.float64(2148.2231749999987))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'a40e486843b3a95a3dbaad6d32f0c950', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '5f2cdb7690fa98d4e01b0c523fa0aa91'}, page_content='The RAG Q&A score test’ is designed to streamline the evaluation of different LLMs’ performances using the RAG, as indicated in Figure 5. This evaluation process involves importing a JSON-formatted dataset and linking it with an established vectorstore rele- vant to the selected domain. The automation embedded within this menu facilitates a me- thodical assessment of the LLMs, leveraging domain-specific knowledge embedded within the vectorstore.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8507989645004272, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(801.7767333984375), np.float64(3760.340208333333)), (np.float64(801.7767333984375), np.float64(3804.440673828125)), (np.float64(2355.66296913889), np.float64(3804.440673828125)), (np.float64(2355.66296913889), np.float64(3760.340208333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'FigureCaption', 'element_id': '9b398dad2247668303bd3b82c0dec54d'}, page_content='Figure 5. Workﬂow diagram for RAG LLM query processing and score storage.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8402398228645325, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2563.222900390625), np.float64(258.2770080566406)), (np.float64(2563.222900390625), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.6114375625), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.6114375625), np.float64(258.2770080566406))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 10, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'a7e12b7e1b4cc4e97342348a67a96cd6'}, page_content='10 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8977473378181458, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(175.0), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(175.0), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9514315724372864, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(457.0351867675781)), (np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.3058791666667), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.3058791666667), np.float64(457.0351867675781))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '6a62c7a6742ba24346c039fac148b7d9'}, page_content='Vectorstores, once created using a speciﬁc LLM’s transformers, require the consistent application of the same LLM model during the RAG process. Within this automated framework, each question from the dataset is processed by the LLM to produce a corre- sponding answer. Then, both the generated answers and their associated reference an- swers are evaluated by a backend Python script. This script calculates performance met- rics, records these metrics on the blockchain under a speciﬁed test series, and iterates this procedure for every item within the dataset.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9466695189476013, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(893.482391666665)), (np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.583516666667), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.583516666667), np.float64(893.482391666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e4706dfe857501fa708f4269c62f44ad'}, page_content='The Show test results’ feature is designed to access and display the evaluation out- comes from various tests as recorded on the blockchain, presenting them in an organized tabular format. This feature facilitates the visualization of score results for individual an- swers across different test series and also provides the functionality to export this data into an xlsx file format. The export feature makes it much easier for users to understand and study the data, helping with better evaluations and insights.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9428861141204834, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(1267.396783333331)), (np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(1690.0097666666636)), (np.float64(2731.3643291666676), np.float64(1690.0097666666636)), (np.float64(2731.3643291666676), np.float64(1267.396783333331))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3a956cc74be94b6f989ff51809bdfbfe'}, page_content='The Q&A Time LLM Test’ feature evaluates model performance across various hard- ware setups using JSON-formatted question—answer pairs. Upon submission, the PaSSER App prompts the selected model for responses, generating detailed performance metrics like evaluation and load times, among others. These metrics are packed in a query to a backend Python script, which records the data on the blockchain via the ‘addtimetest’ ac- tion, interacting with the ‘I/mtest’ smart contract to ensure performance tracking and data integrity.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9417404532432556, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(803.5913696289062), np.float64(1703.4289124999966)), (np.float64(803.5913696289062), np.float64(2001.5092999999968)), (np.float64(2731.481229166666), np.float64(2001.5092999999968)), (np.float64(2731.481229166666), np.float64(1703.4289124999966))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8e66c5bc6f4abb52d3ae90a9725b28b8'}, page_content='The Show time test results’ makes it easy to access and view LLM performance data, organized by test series, from the blockchain. When displayed in a structured table, these metrics can be examined for comprehensive performance assessment. There is an option to export this data into an xlsx file, thereby improving the process for further in-depth examination and analysis.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9327051639556885, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(2014.9235749999968)), (np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(2312.999091666664)), (np.float64(2731.364329166667), np.float64(2312.999091666664)), (np.float64(2731.364329166667), np.float64(2014.9235749999968))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd61d53771172a55b26b6ec03cc4d5af9'}, page_content='Authentication within the system (eLogin’) is provided through the Anchor wallet, which is compliant with the security protocols of the SCPDx platform. This process, de- scribed in detail in [34], provides user authentication by ensuring that testing activities are securely associated with the correct user credentials. This strengthens the integrity and accountability of the testing process within the platform ecosystem.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.709331214427948, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(912.0447583333334), np.float64(2326.4133666666635)), (np.float64(912.0447583333334), np.float64(2375.121699999997)), (np.float64(2453.4297083333336), np.float64(2375.121699999997)), (np.float64(2453.4297083333336), np.float64(2326.4133666666635))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f272f5e726273aea9446684726258835'}, page_content='The Configuration’ feature is divided into Settings’ and edd Model’.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9442151188850403, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(804.5418701171875), np.float64(2387.01123046875)), (np.float64(804.5418701171875), np.float64(2811.441208333331)), (np.float64(2731.2035916666673), np.float64(2811.441208333331)), (np.float64(2731.2035916666673), np.float64(2387.01123046875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ac872b07ffddebcd8c4c68efe46b251f'}, page_content='The Settings’ is designed for configuring connectivity to the Ollama API and Chro- maDB API, using IP addresses specified in the application’s configuration file. It also al- lows users to select an LLM that is currently installed in Ollama. A key feature here is the ability to adjust the demperature’ parameter, which ranges from 0 to 1, to fine-tune the balance between creativity and predictability in the output generated by the LLM. Setting a higher temperature value (>0.8) increases randomness, whereas a lower value enhances determinism, with the default set at 0.2.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.921870231628418, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7921333333331), np.float64(2824.8554833333305)), (np.float64(808.7921333333331), np.float64(2998.4530916666668)), (np.float64(2744.7197265625), np.float64(2998.4530916666668)), (np.float64(2744.7197265625), np.float64(2824.8554833333305))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd910c77b17d048b4ca95e8f58e81a231'}, page_content='The edd Model’ enables adding and removing LLMs in the Ollama API, allowing dynamic model management. This feature is useful when testing different models, ensur- ing optimal use of computational resources.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9343501925468445, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(800.77392578125), np.float64(3011.8673666666664)), (np.float64(800.77392578125), np.float64(3309.942883333333)), (np.float64(2734.344970703125), np.float64(3309.942883333333)), (np.float64(2734.344970703125), np.float64(3011.8673666666664))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3dffaaf2f385052f05becfb44ce148ba'}, page_content='The Manage DB’ feature displays a comprehensive list of vectorstores available in ChromaDB, offering functionalities to inspect or interact with specific dataset records. This feature enables users to view details within a record’s JSON response. It provides the option to delete any vectorstore that is no longer needed, enabling efficient database man- agement by removing obsolete or redundant data, thereby optimizing storage utilization.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.867879331111908, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(793.5636596679688), np.float64(3323.3571583333332)), (np.float64(793.5636596679688), np.float64(3434.4803499999994)), (np.float64(2752.572265625), np.float64(3434.4803499999994)), (np.float64(2752.572265625), np.float64(3323.3571583333332))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 11, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': 'b66c097239fdfaa3fe8e23adfb13a097', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4c39161658e3c40ac89642da3e3abd2f'}, page_content='A block diagram representation of the PaSSER App’s operational logic that illustrates the interactions between the various components is provided in Figure 6.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8604212403297424, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2561.370361328125), np.float64(256.98419189453125)), (np.float64(2561.370361328125), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.608866666667), np.float64(299.765375)