on two diﬀerent hardware conﬁgu- rations and to assess the performance of these models in generating answers using RAG on the selected knowledge domain, smart agriculture.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9455386400222778, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7994833333338), np.float64(2458.565404166666)), (np.float64(808.7994833333338), np.float64(2881.1783875)), (np.float64(2731.3320125000014), np.float64(2881.1783875)), (np.float64(2731.3320125000014), np.float64(2458.565404166666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 19, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '72acc25cf5fbc9131fcbf4a2afdb7614', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3ee5d89d811755ab981720ee4dd12e36'}, page_content='The knowledge base used was retrieved from EU Regulation 2018/848 “https://eur- lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:32018R0848 (accessed on 1 April 2024)” and Climate-smart agriculture Sourcebook “https://www.fao.org/3/i3325e/i3325e.pdf (accessed on 1 April 2024)”. These documents were pre-processed manually and vectorized using the transformers of Misrtal:7b, Llama2:7b, and Orca2:7b LLMs under the following parameters: chunk size—500, over- lapping—100, temperature—0.2.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9466305375099182, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7994833333344), np.float64(2894.5926625)), (np.float64(808.7994833333344), np.float64(3628.6954375)), (np.float64(2731.5365874999998), np.float64(3628.6954375)), (np.float64(2731.5365874999998), np.float64(2894.5926625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 19, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '72acc25cf5fbc9131fcbf4a2afdb7614', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '071d45ce84e3561681a6cb973efd779f'}, page_content='The dataset containing reference answers speciﬁc to smart agriculture was compiled and stored as a text ﬁle. The Mistral:7b model was deployed to formulate questions based on these reference answers. Initial trials indicated that Mistral:7b excelled in generating questions with high relevance within this particular domain. To initiate the question gen- eration process, the following prompt was employed: “Imagine you are a virtual assistant trained in the detailed regulations of organic agriculture. Your task involves creating pre- cise questions for a speciﬁc regulatory statement provided to you below. The statement comes directly from the regulations, and your challenge is to reverse-engineer the ques- tion that this statement answers. Your formulated question should be concise, clear, and directly related to the content of the statement. Aim to craft your question without imply- ing the statement itself as the answer, and, where relevant, gear your question toward eliciting speciﬁc events, facts, or regulations.”'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8897247314453125, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7994833333345), np.float64(3642.4019624999996)), (np.float64(808.7994833333345), np.float64(3753.2329041666667)), (np.float64(2728.498291015625), np.float64(3753.2329041666667)), (np.float64(2728.498291015625), np.float64(3642.4019624999996))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 19, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '72acc25cf5fbc9131fcbf4a2afdb7614', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '94ffd2fa57e02fc96ee6b4067e984ce4'}, page_content='For testing purposes, two Ollama APIs installed on two diﬀerent hardware conﬁgu- rations were used:'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8018332123756409, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.8733520507812), np.float64(3777.9669958333334)), (np.float64(807.8733520507812), np.float64(3830.2310375)), (np.float64(2224.687412500001), np.float64(3830.2310375)), (np.float64(2224.687412500001), np.float64(3777.9669958333334))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 19, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '72acc25cf5fbc9131fcbf4a2afdb7614', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': '2b72cf2e729c07039e7ad30834bb970a'}, page_content='Intel Xeon, 32 Cores, 0 GPU, 128 GB RAM, Ubuntu 22.04 OS.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8965939879417419, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(174.0935516357422), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(174.0935516357422), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.5025790929794312, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.5771484375), np.float64(454.1916749999994)), (np.float64(805.5771484375), np.float64(506.45571666666643)), (np.float64(2075.0146666666665), np.float64(506.45571666666643)), (np.float64(2075.0146666666665), np.float64(454.1916749999994))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'ListItem', 'element_id': 'a714f10c1b9fa2734fd916b92618aaaa'}, page_content='- Mac Mini M1, 8 CPU, 10 GPU, 16 GB RAM, OSX 13.4.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8865290284156799, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(534.4532666666664)), (np.float64(808.7928333333332), np.float64(645.2842083333329)), (np.float64(2731.0964333333327), np.float64(645.2842083333329)), (np.float64(2731.0964333333327), np.float64(534.4532666666664))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '7e3fa2777674f72ce3364df09d770bf7'}, page_content='In the PASSER App, the installed Ollama APIs that were to be used could be selected. This is set in the conﬁguration->settings menu.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.855272114276886, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(801.8339233398438), np.float64(658.9907333333327)), (np.float64(801.8339233398438), np.float64(770.113924999999)), (np.float64(2731.2376874999995), np.float64(770.113924999999)), (np.float64(2731.2376874999995), np.float64(658.9907333333327))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'a9cc7e1e5775508f035dcb4e58e7d303'}, page_content='The two following tests were designed: testing via the ‘Q&A Time LLM Test’ and the RAG Q&A score test’.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9445207715034485, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8074458333338), np.float64(783.528199999999)), (np.float64(808.8074458333338), np.float64(1206.1460541666645)), (np.float64(2731.4958416666677), np.float64(1206.1460541666645)), (np.float64(2731.4958416666677), np.float64(783.528199999999))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0bd6bf550d6ddc042d5ea03b7c53511f'}, page_content='The Q&A Time LLM Test’ evaluated LLM performance across two hardware config- urations using a dataset of 446 questions for each model, focusing on seven specific met- rics (evaluation time, evaluation count, load duration time, prompt evaluation count, prompt evaluation duration, total duration, and tokens per second). These metrics were integral for analyzing the efficiency and responsiveness of each model under different computational conditions. The collected data was stored on a blockchain, ensuring both transparency and traceability of the evaluation results.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9330975413322449, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8123166666682), np.float64(1219.5651999999982)), (np.float64(808.8123166666682), np.float64(1455.2258583333307)), (np.float64(2741.286865234375), np.float64(1455.2258583333307)), (np.float64(2741.286865234375), np.float64(1219.5651999999982))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ff3eb82e4d4cc916401f715cae181c65'}, page_content='The RAG Q&A score test’ aimed to evaluate the performance of the models based on 13 metrics (METEOR, ROUGE-1, ROUGE-I, BLEU, perplexity, cosine similarity, Pear- son correlation, and F1) applied to each of the 446 questions—reference answers—for which RAG obtained answers.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9427541494369507, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(801.9343872070312), np.float64(1468.9323833333306)), (np.float64(801.9343872070312), np.float64(1829.1305083333305)), (np.float64(2739.71923828125), np.float64(1829.1305083333305)), (np.float64(2739.71923828125), np.float64(1468.9323833333306))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e308198ea568fb9fd82b0ccb5c59ad37'}, page_content='The RAG Q&A score test’ evaluated the performance of different models in a chat environment with enhanced RAG O&A, identifying differences and patterns in their abil- ity to respond to queries. Its goal was to determine the model that best provided accurate, context-aware responses that defined terms and summarized specific content. This evalu- ation can be used to select a model that ensures the delivery of accurate and relevant in- formation in the context of the specific knowledge provided.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9098178744316101, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.