ILE.xlsx (accessed on 1 April 2024)”.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.928061306476593, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(804.4819946289062), np.float64(2216.454304166664)), (np.float64(804.4819946289062), np.float64(2389.7049749999974)), (np.float64(2731.625244140625), np.float64(2389.7049749999974)), (np.float64(2731.625244140625), np.float64(2216.454304166664))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '540f648776ffb1e10d33478b17884a0d', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'fb9a1b22375af41d845a7ff5da63aa03'}, page_content='In the upcoming section, the focus is solely on presenting and analysing the mean values derived from the test data. This approach eases the interpretation, enabling a sum- marized review of the core ﬁndings and trends across the conducted evaluations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6616514325141907, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8171875000015), np.float64(2461.7445999999973)), (np.float64(808.8171875000015), np.float64(2510.4529333333307)), (np.float64(1491.488833333335), np.float64(2510.4529333333307)), (np.float64(1491.488833333335), np.float64(2461.7445999999973))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 20, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44