nt_id': '5b890b5755075c53a39ed2fb6492ee75'}, page_content='Data on the current market price of the RAM resource is retrieved from an oracle [16] every 60 min that runs within the SCPDx platform whose blockchain infrastructure is be- ing used.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9364771842956543, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879625000004), np.float64(644.4074583333326)), (np.float64(808.7879625000004), np.float64(942.1907249999982)), (np.float64(2731.2961374999973), np.float64(942.1907249999982)), (np.float64(2731.2961374999973), np.float64(644.4074583333326))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '054273029e8b4e22109953b178b4a73a'}, page_content='The current price of RAM is 0.01503345 SYS/kB as of 23 March 2024, 2:05 PM. Assum- ing the price of 1 SYS is equal to the price of 1 EOS, it is possible to compare the price of the RAM used if the tests are run on the public Antelope blockchain because there is a quote of the EOS RAM Token in USD and it does not depend on the account used. The quote is available at “https://coinmarketcap.com/ (accessed on 23 March 2024)”.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9353662133216858, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(796.9816284179688), np.float64(955.897249999998)), (np.float64(796.9816284179688), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.924474999999), np.float64(1253.6902583333313)), (np.float64(2731.924474999999), np.float64(955.897249999998))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '4900dafcbd4f2327d63d5daae4bfb18c'}, page_content='Table 3 shows that in terms of RAM usage and the associated costs in SYS and USD, the score tests require more resources than the timing tests. The total cost of using block- chain resources for these tests is less than 50 USD. This gives reason to assume that using blockchain to manage and document test results has promise. The RAM price, measured in SYS per kilobyte (kB), remains constant across diﬀerent tests in the blockchain network.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8563509583473206, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(807.881103515625), np.float64(1324.3397222222222)), (np.float64(807.881103515625), np.float64(1368.0897222222222)), (np.float64(1393.0510416666664), np.float64(1368.0897222222222)), (np.float64(1393.0510416666664), np.float64(1324.3397222222222))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '744a5e4e184560126dd9ead6d80df106'}, page_content='Table 3. Blockchain test costs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.6711627840995789, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(792.7406005859375), np.float64(1754.5485416666666)), (np.float64(792.7406005859375), np.float64(1798.2985416666666)), (np.float64(2585.391666666666), np.float64(1798.2985416666666)), (np.float64(2585.391666666666), np.float64(1754.5485416666666))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd678fe9a75b6811e2f6a7b9c6c3c54b1'}, page_content='* Six series of 446 blockchain transactions. ** Three series of 446 blockchain BC transactions.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9500678181648254, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(806.5945434570312), np.float64(1866.2674560546875)), (np.float64(806.5945434570312), np.float64(2292.9127666666664)), (np.float64(2731.444041666667), np.float64(2292.9127666666664)), (np.float64(2731.444041666667), np.float64(1866.2674560546875))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'ffc594135fac18acbc46c51105670477'}, page_content='This means that blockchain developers and users can anticipate and plan for the costs associated with their blockchain operations. The blockchain resource pricing model is de- signed to maintain a predictable and reliable cost structure. This predictability matters for the long-term sustainability and scalability of blockchain projects as it allows for accurate cost estimation and resource allocation. However, the real value of implementing block- chain must also consider the beneﬁts of increased transparency, security and traceability against these costs.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8270866870880127, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(804.8389892578125), np.float64(2364.9523916666662)), (np.float64(804.8389892578125), np.float64(2413.6607249999997)), (np.float64(1114.5709166666663), np.float64(2413.6607249999997)), (np.float64(1114.5709166666663), np.float64(2364.9523916666662))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '4708ad1615e005b7976edadac2ec04cc', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '59c478d8430acecb62ccb64e33821ccd'}, page_content='5. Discussion'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9286271333694458, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7994833333329), np.float64(2439.65673828125)), (np.float64(808.7994833333329), np.float64(2614.904075)), (np.float64(2732.86474609375), np.float64(2614.904075)), (np.float64(2732.86474609375), np.float64(2439.65673828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '59c478d8430acecb62ccb64e33821ccd', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '44329c49dc65bf761a35f2e53a031079'}, page_content='The PaSSER App testing observations reveal several aspects that aﬀect the acquired results and the performance and can be managed. These are data cleaning and pre-pro- cessing, chunk sizes, GPU usage, and RAM size.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9449223875999451, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7994833333329), np.float64(2628.6106)), (np.float64(808.7994833333329), np.float64(2988.8135958333332)), (np.float64(2731.2492083333327), np.float64(2988.8135958333332)), (np.float64(2731.2492083333327), np.float64(2628.6106))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '59c478d8430acecb62ccb64e33821ccd', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '60cf3f2706df4884f098bce882ee3a61'}, page_content='Data cleaning and pre-processing cannot be fully automated. In addition to removing special characters and hyperlinks, it is also necessary to remove non-essential or errone- ous information, standardize formats, and correct errors from the primary data. This is done manually. At this stage, the PaSSER App processes only textual information; there- fore, the normalization of data, handling of missing data, and detection and removal of deviations are not considered.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9388909339904785, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.64599609375), np.float64(3002.5201208333333)), (np.float64(805.64599609375), np.float64(3362.718245833333)), (np.float64(2737.789306640625), np.float64(3362.718245833333)), (np.float64(2737.789306640625), np.float64(3002.5201208333333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '59c478d8430acecb62ccb64e33821ccd', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'c5fb9c6bb3a59d2a8aa86ea78948755e'}, page_content='Selecting documents with current, validated, and accurate data is pivotal, yet this process cannot be entirely automated. What can be achieved is to ensure traceability and record the updates and origins of both primary and processed data, along with their se- cure storage. Blockchain and distributed ﬁle systems can be used for this purpose. Here, this objective is partially implemented since blockchain is used solely to record the testing results.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.938176155090332, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(805.1800537109375), np.float64(3376.132520833333)), (np.float64(805.1800537109375), np.float64(3737.271484375)), (np.float64(2731.2833041666654), np.float64(3737.271484375)), (np.float64(2731.2833041666654), np.float64(3376.132520833333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '59c478d8430acecb62ccb64e33821ccd', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e8cfdef6ed02fa6e8057d02f5bd64a57'}, page_content='The second aspect is chunk sizes when creating and using vectorstores. Smaller chunks require less memory and computational resources. This is at the expense of in- creased iterations and overall execution time, which is balanced by greater concurrency in query processing. On the other hand, larger chunks provide more context but may be more demanding on resources and potentially slow down processes if not managed eﬃ- ciently.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8609875440597534, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2561.60400390625), np.float64(256.26080322265625)), (np.float64(2561.60400390625), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.608866666667), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(2728.608866666667), np.float64(256.26080322265625))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 27, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '1db2c27b326910e81c9fd921fef334f2'}, page_content='27 of 31'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8968166708946228, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(174.9474639892578), np.float64(260.9737083333338)), (np.float64(174.9474639892578), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(299.765375)), (np.float64(602.0690958333333), np.float64(260.9737083333338))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'category': 'Header', 'element_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7'}, page_content='Electronics 2024, 13, 1361'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9501927495002747, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(456.38409423828125)), (np.float64(808.7879624999996), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.218204166665), np.float64(880.0681166666651)), (np.float64(2731.218204166665), np.float64(456.38409423828125))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '926ee9ec215d5c3692df93464c2f9a55'}, page_content='Adjusting the chunk size aﬀects both the recall and precision of the results. Adequate chunk size is essential to ensure a balance between the retrieval and generation tasks in RAG, as over- or undersized chunks can negatively impact one or both components. In the tests, 500-character chunk sizes were found to give the best results. In this particular implementation, no metadata added (document type or section labels) is used in the vec- torstore creation process, which would facilitate more targeted processing when using smaller chunks.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9436604380607605, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7879624999994), np.float64(893.482391666665)), (np.float64(808.7879624999994), np.float64(1316.1051166666643)), (np.float64(2731.505583333332), np.float64(1316.1051166666643)), (np.float64(2731.505583333332), np.float64(893.482391666665))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'd9b241233f0cb4b62ca0198fb77205f6'}, page_content='GPU usage and RAM size obviously aﬀect the performance of the models. It is evi- dent from the results that hardware conﬁgurations that do not use the GPU perform sig- niﬁcantly slower on the text generation and summarization tasks. Models with fewer pa- rameters (up to 13b) can run reasonably well on 16 GB RAM conﬁgurations. Larger mod- els need more resources, both in terms of RAM and GPU resources. This is the reason, in this particular implementation, to use the selected small LLMs, which are suitable for standard and commonly available hardware conﬁgurations and platforms.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9443803429603577, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(803.7268676757812), np.float64(1329.8116416666642)), (np.float64(803.7268676757812), np.float64(1690.8773193359375)), (np.float64(2742.8681640625), np.float64(1690.8773193359375)), (np.float64(2742.8681640625), np.float64(1329.8116416666642))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '8a8c4341bae7f1cf4a7ceb4398339784'}, page_content='It is important to note that the choice of a model may vary depending on the speciﬁc requirements of a given task, including the desired balance between creativity and accu- racy, the importance of ﬂuency versus content ﬁdelity, and the computational resources available. Therefore, while Mistral:7b appears to be the most versatile and capable model based on the provided metrics, the selection of a model should be guided by the speciﬁc objectives and constraints of the application in question.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9506014585494995, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7977041666642), np.float64(1703.4289124999966)), (np.float64(808.7977041666642), np.float64(2312.999091666664)), (np.float64(2731.622483333334), np.float64(2312.999091666664)), (np.float64(2731.622483333334), np.float64(1703.4289124999966))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '3dccfbd457bb825d6c479936cdfd2434'}, page_content='While promising, the use of RAG-equipped LLMs requires caution regarding data accuracy, privacy concerns, and ethical implications. This is of particular importance in the healthcare domain, where the goal is to assist medical professionals and researchers by accessing the latest medical research, clinical guidelines, and patient data, as well as assisting diagnostic processes, treatment planning, and medical education. Pre-trained open-source models can be found on Huggingface [45]. For example, TheBloke/medicine- LLM-13B-GPTQ is used for medical question answering, patient record summarization, aiding medical diagnosis, and general health Q&A [46]. Another model is m42- health/med42-70b [47]. However, this application requires measures to ensure accuracy, privacy, and compliance with health regulations.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.8505784273147583, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(806.5715942382812), np.float64(2385.0387166666637)), (np.float64(806.5715942382812), np.float64(2433.747049999997)), (np.float64(1144.9631374999979), np.float64(2433.747049999997)), (np.float64(1144.9631374999979), np.float64(2385.0387166666637))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '56d5a19c1d52054e01059dda973c05e7', 'category': 'Title', 'element_id': '2931ef9c06d97c7122146737fc42015e'}, page_content='6. Conclusions'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9360544085502625, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7977041666643), np.float64(2461.74947083333)), (np.float64(808.7977041666643), np.float64(2697.4149999999977)), (np.float64(2737.361083984375), np.float64(2697.4149999999977)), (np.float64(2737.361083984375), np.float64(2461.74947083333))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '2931ef9c06d97c7122146737fc42015e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '9cd68fc0e90527f3fe7b0eb636d1b226'}, page_content='This paper presented the development, integration, and use of the PaSSER web ap- plication, designed to leverage RAG technology with LLMs for enhanced document re- trieval and analysis. Despite the explicit focus on smart agriculture as the chosen speciﬁc domain, the application can be used in other areas.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9436486959457397, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7977041666645), np.float64(2711.1215249999973)), (np.float64(808.7977041666645), np.float64(3071.319649999997)), (np.float64(2731.4130374999972), np.float64(3071.319649999997)), (np.float64(2731.4130374999972), np.float64(2711.1215249999973))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '2931ef9c06d97c7122146737fc42015e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': '0f39ab86e2cfea174d9bc52ff7f25e8d'}, page_content='The web application integrates Mistral:7b, Llama2:7b, and Orca2:7b LLMs, selected for their performance and compatibility with medium computational capacity hardware. It has built-in testing modules that evaluate the performance of the LLMs in real-time by a set of 13 evaluation metrics (ROUGE-1 recall, precision, f-score; ROUGE-l recall, preci- sion, f-score; BLUE, Laplace perplexity, Lidstone perplexity, cosine similarity, Pearson correlation, F1 score).'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9480913281440735, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.8025749999975), np.float64(3084.7339249999973)), (np.float64(808.8025749999975), np.float64(3569.469516666664)), (np.float64(2731.2669124999966), np.float64(3569.469516666664)), (np.float64(2731.2669124999966), np.float64(3084.7339249999973))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '2931ef9c06d97c7122146737fc42015e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'e8440b80cff344e82215236b3faace91'}, page_content='The LLMs were tested via the ‘Q&A Time LLM Test’ and RAG Q&A score test’ func- tionalities of the PaSSER App. The ‘Q&A Time LLM Test’ was focused on assessing LLMs across two hardware configurations. From the results of the ‘Q&A Time LLM Test’, it can be concluded that even when working with 7b models, the presence of GPUs is crucial for text generation speed. The lowest total duration times were shown by Orca2:7b on the Mac M1 system. From the results of the ‘RAG Q&A Score Test’ applied to the selected metrics over the dataset of 446 question—answer pairs, the Mistral:7b model exhibited su- perior performance.'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.9344072341918945, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(808.7916666666666), np.float64(3583.1760416666643)), (np.float64(808.7916666666666), np.float64(3818.912747222222)), (np.float64(2734.34716796875), np.float64(3818.912747222222)), (np.float64(2734.34716796875), np.float64(3583.1760416666643))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'parent_id': '2931ef9c06d97c7122146737fc42015e', 'category': 'NarrativeText', 'element_id': 'f642e43128548935956e5dd071a0ed61'}, page_content='The PaSSER App leverages a private, permissionless Antelope blockchain network for documenting and verifying results from LLMs’ testing. The system operates on a to- ken-based economy (SYS) to manage RAM, CPU, and NET resources. RAM usage and associated costs, measured in SYS and USD, indicate that the total cost for blockchain'), Document(metadata={'source': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T/rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77b32cba42d667a.pdf', 'detection_class_prob': 0.851865291595459, 'is_extracted': 'true', 'coordinates': {'points': ((np.float64(2562.844970703125), np.float64(256.8398132324219)), (np.float64(2562.844970703125), np.float64(299.99072265625)), (np.float64(2728.608866666667), np.float64(299.99072265625)), (np.float64(2728.608866666667), np.float64(256.8398132324219))), 'system': 'PixelSpace', 'layout_width': 2894, 'layout_height': 4094}, 'last_modified': '2026-08-24T16:05:13', 'filetype': 'application/pdf', 'languages': ['eng'], 'page_number': 28, 'file_directory': '/var/folders/5z/p05w2vpj7b90clpntd1kvyp80000gp/T', 'filename': 'rag_upload_44c3d19297fec5dad77